TEXT 96 -40 Left 2 ;Chapter 19: AC coupling into a mid-supply bias (2.5 V). Plot V(out): the response rises at 20 dB per decade, then is flat.
TEXT 96 -8 Left 2 ;fc = 1/(2 pi (Rin + R1||R2) C) = 10.6 Hz. Above fc the gain is R1||R2 / (Rin + R1||R2) = 1/3. The 2.5 V DC level does not show in an AC analysis.
